Debug mode highlights a TOML file's header comment, each root key, and each table's whole header, not values or the comments above keys.
Expected output is hand-written: the TypeScript build has no data file support.
== args
--debug
input/a.toml
== file input/a.toml
# Settings.

# The root key.
key = 1
[table.name]
x = 2
== stdout
\x1b[32m# Settings.\x1b[0m

# The root key.
\x1b[32mkey\x1b[0m = 1
\x1b[32m[table.name]\x1b[0m
x = 2
== stderr
== exit 0
